### Sign up
POST {{baseUrl}}/shop/signup
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "name": "John Doe",
    "email": "john5.doe@example.com",
    "password": "password"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/shop/login
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "email": "john5.doe@example.com",
    "password": "password"
}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/shop/logout
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-client-id: {{userId}}
Authorization: {{accessToken}}

### Handle refresh token
POST {{baseUrl}}/shop/handle-refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-client-id: {{userId}}
Authorization: {{accessToken}}
x-refresh-token: {{refreshToken}}